WEBVTT

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:18.990
 The fears, I believe, are that water will run out, that water will get to be really expensive, but then I think that they also have fear of flood.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:26.990
 I mean, we go back and forth from drought to flood, so extremes of weather, I think, are what's in store for us,

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:31.990
 and I think one of the keys is to be resilient to whatever comes along.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:41.110
 The weather is going to be increasingly unpredictable, that we have to be able to survive and cope and store water

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:48.300
 and have more groundwater and conserve more and save rainwater, learning how to do with less.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:56.490
 And the hope, I think, the hope is that some people with imagination will be able to come up with some new ideas

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:02.550
 about how to live with a very scarce and finite resource.

